      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22730/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Line a 9x13-inch pan with waxed paper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pAlWpiLwnM5WupvjaaDilDDJbJo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22730-RockyRoadCandies-ddmfs-4x3-gw-step-02-0087-779d1fd7c79a4b52b4107a0eebfc55d4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22730/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat chocolate chips and butter in a microwave-safe bowl in 30-second increments, stirring occasionally, until melted and smooth. Stir in condensed milk.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XGqZ-3QR-Lvsm0Az2TiYcje3LMw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22730-RockyRoadCandies-ddmfs-4x3-gw-step-04-0088-b3eb37c9c74a4b28890aded3263f8f38.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22730/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix peanuts and mini marshmallows together in a separate bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/c-ALUOiAG-pp0A1VGDWcQ8TVDzc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22730-RockyRoadCandies-ddmfs-4x3-gw-step-05-0089-24cd635387b04a87a933e41f2022d5ba.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22730/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gradually stir into chocolate mixture until incorporated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XM5AzHuoMwt0xl1aENs0p2sU-l8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22730-RockyRoadCandies-ddmfs-4x3-gw-step-06-0091-bccb807c4d594c73a8d17176155c371d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22730/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour into the prepared pan. Refrigerate until firm, about 2 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
